OL,3,APrince William joins royalty and world
OL,4,Aleaders at King Harald's funeral
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes are being paid to King Harald
OL,7,FV after his funeral in Norway's capital
OL,8,FOslo, with the Prince of Wales and
OL,9,Fother European royals among attendees -
OL,10,Fwatch live coverage above
OL,12,FFlags have been raised from half-mast
OL,13,Fto mark the conclusion of a private
OL,14,Fceremony at Akershus Fortress, where
OL,15,Fthe king was laid to rest in the crypt
OL,16,Fof the Palace Chapel after a public
OL,17,Fservice at Oslo Cathedral
OL,19,FTens of thousands of people are lining
OL,20,Fthe streets to pay their respects after
OL,21,F13 days of national mourning
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
