OL,3,APrince William joins royalty and world
OL,4,Aleaders at King Harald's funeral
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe late monarch died in August after
OL,7,F35 years on the throne - here's a mini
OL,8,Fprofile of the 89-year-old. His son,
OL,9,FHaakon VIII, has now succeeded him
OL,11,FPrince William is representing King
OL,12,FCharles while Princess Anne - godmother
OL,13,Fto the new Norwegian king - is in
OL,14,Fattendance but in a private capacity
OL,16,FAs well as European royalty,
OL,17,Finternational figures such as King
OL,18,FAbdullah II of Jordan and Ukraine's
OL,19,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky are at the
OL,20,Ffuneral
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
